I hope you're all enjoying the exhibition.

17
00:01:47,530 --> 00:01:49,530
I know that I am.

18
00:01:49,530 --> 00:01:52,530
And I would like to introduce the young man

19
00:01:52,530 --> 00:01:54,530
who spent the last five years

20
00:01:54,530 --> 00:01:56,530
taking these remarkable pictures

21
00:01:56,530 --> 00:02:00,530
and writing the background for Family Album,U.S.A.--

22
00:02:00,530 --> 00:02:14,530
Mr. Richard Stewart. Richard Stewarrt

23
00:02:14,530 --> 00:02:15,530
Hello.

24
00:02:15,530 --> 00:02:19,530
I want to thank all of you for coming here tonight.

25
00:02:19,530 --> 00:02:22,530
I'd like to thank Harvey Carlson

26
00:02:22,530 --> 00:02:23,530
