Our pleasure.

36
00:03:06,530 --> 00:03:07,530
Hope it wins a Pulitzer Prize.

37
00:03:07,530 --> 00:03:09,530
I'll settle for an "A" in my photography course.

38
00:03:09,530 --> 00:03:20,530
Ah, Richard, Marilyn, I want you to meet John O'Neill.

39
00:03:20,530 --> 00:03:21,530
Oh, how do you do?

40
00:03:21,530 --> 00:03:22,530
Nice to meet you.

41
