Thank you.

44
00:03:29,530 --> 00:03:31,530
In fact, I'd like your autograph.

45
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:32,530
Oh, well, really ...

46
00:03:32,530 --> 00:03:34,530
On a contract.

47
00:03:34,530 --> 00:03:38,530
What's this about, Harvey?

48
00:03:38,530 --> 00:03:41,530
Mr. O'Neill is the publisher of several magazines. O'Neill

49
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:44,530
Of course. I've seen you on television.

50
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:47,530
Mr. O'Neill was so impressed with your work O'Neill

51
00:03:47,530 --> 00:03:49,530
that he wants to develop it into a magazine concept.

52
00:03:49,530 --> 00:03:53,530
Well, that sounds very exciting,

53
00:03:53,530 --> 00:03:56,530
