67
00:04:33,530 --> 00:04:35,530
I'm flattered,

68
00:04:35,530 --> 00:04:38,530
but I enjoy taking pictures, and I want to continue doing that.

69
00:04:38,530 --> 00:04:42,530
Thank you,

70
00:04:42,530 --> 00:04:45,530
but I'm happy being a photographer.

71
00:04:45,530 --> 00:04:47,530
I understand, Richard.

72
00:04:47,530 --> 00:04:51,530
Richard, I know your next book will be a success. Richard

73
00:04:51,530 --> 00:04:53,530
Congratulations!

74
00:04:53,530 --> 00:04:54,530
Thanks.

75
00:04:54,530 --> 00:05:02,530
